        "description": {
          "value": "<p class=\"feature\"><em>Dexterity Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=raCgBtHIqk0an7OF]], one creature the [[lookup @name lowercase]]{flumph} can see within 15 feet. <em>Failure:</em> The target is coated in a foul-smelling liquid, exudes a stench for 1d4 hours, and has the &amp;Reference[Poisoned] condition while the stench lasts. Other creatures have the Poisoned condition while in a 5-foot Emanation originating from the coated target. The target can remove the stench on itself if it bathes during a Short or Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-KEG4Ku1Sq4jsJ0Qy\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Sur un échec, appliquez l’effet <em>Stench</em> (Poisoned) à la cible et lancez sa durée depuis la carte ([[/r 1d4]] heures). L’Emanation de 5 ft qui empoisonne les autres créatures n’est pas automatisée.</p></section>",
